<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="container verify-wrap">
  <div class="vhead"><%- include('../partials/logo') %><div><h1 class="mb0">Official Verification Portal</h1><div class="muted">Check the authenticity and status of a <%= brand %> credential.</div></div></div>
  <img class="photo banner" src="/static/images/verify.webp" alt="A phone scanning the QR code of a credential." width="1600" height="500">
  <% if (error) { %><div class="alert error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
  <form class="card" method="get" action="/verify">
    <div class="field"><label for="id">Credential ID</label><input id="id" name="id" value="<%= id %>" placeholder="LIV-2026-7KQ4M9XZ" required autocomplete="off"><div class="hint">Printed under the QR code on the credential.</div></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="ln">Holder's last name <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label><input id="ln" name="last_name" value="<%= last_name %>"><div class="hint">Adds a second check that the credential belongs to this person.</div></div>
    <button class="btn lg">Verify</button>
  </form>
  <p class="small muted mt">For privacy, certificates can't be searched by name alone. Scanning the QR code on the certificate opens its verification page directly.</p>
  <h2 class="h3 mt" id="other-checks">Other checks</h2>
  <div class="grid g3 mt">
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Training provider</h3><p class="small">Confirm that a provider is an Authorized Training Provider, with its status, scope and level.</p><a href="/partners/verify">Check a provider</a></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Membership</h3><p class="small">Confirm that a membership is active today. A membership is not a credential.</p><a href="/membership/verify">Check a membership</a></div>
    <div class="card"><h3 class="h3">Digital badge</h3><p class="small">Each valid credential and active membership also has a signed digital badge (Open Badges 3.0) that other sites and badge wallets can check with LIV's <a href="/badges/jwks.json">public key</a>. The holder shares it from the credential's QR link or their account.</p></div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
